   • Bleeding / Hemorrhage:      0.28 [HIGH]
   • CNS / Respiratory Sedation: 0.44 [ELEVATED]

5. EVIDENCE-BASED SAFER ALTERNATIVES:
   ➔ Substitute TRAMADOL with ACETAMINOPHEN (Analgesic)
      Rationale: Non-serotonergic analgesic without 5-HT reuptake inhibition properties.
      Advantage: Eliminates fatal Serotonin Syndrome risk in patients taking SSRIs, SNRIs, or MAOIs.

6. PATIENT-FRIENDLY ACTIONABLE GUIDANCE:
